{"unit_id":"felixpu__dsh-settings-params#card-zh","repo":"felixpu/dsh-settings-params","commit":"5cbabfeb452f8851e64dc5fe93023abb8870d352","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-params 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的环境变量管理插件。它提供插件设置页面和宿主端路由，将变量与备注保存在本机 YAML 文件，并把配置同步到宿主进程环境中。你可以编辑、删除变量，选择需要读取新配置的插件并触发热重载，也可以按变量逐项授权模型读取。工具 env_param_list 返回变量名和掩码状态，env_param_get 在获得授权后读取指定值。适合需要集中维护 DSH 插件参数、避免每次修改后重启宿主的用户。安装后在插件页面配置；不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1631-1671","client/client.js:586-700"]}
{"unit_id":"felixpu__dsh-settings-params#card-en","repo":"felixpu/dsh-settings-params","commit":"5cbabfeb452f8851e64dc5fe93023abb8870d352","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-params manages DSH environment variables through a web page. It stores values in a local YAML file and syncs them to the host process. Users can edit variables, reload selected plugins, and grant model access to chosen values. Tools list masked values or read an authorized value.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1631-1671","client/client.js:586-700"]}
