{"unit_id":"felixpu__dsh-settings-params#caveat-model-plaintext","repo":"felixpu/dsh-settings-params","commit":"5cbabfeb452f8851e64dc5fe93023abb8870d352","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-params 使用前须知：授权后，env_param_get 返回的变量明文会进入模型上下文并保留在本次会话记录中；未授权变量不能由该工具读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-50","lib/index.js:1561-1564"]}
